      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: This...isn't what I expected
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: Your final trial. Only by passing these tests, will you get your prize
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: Sure, I get that. But, WHERE are we?! How is this beneath the strangely
        small church?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3].text
      value: The Lord works in mysterious ways, and so on and so forth. Just watch
        out for the spikes and lets continue
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
